ng–acting–interacting build upon each other\". Good, quote covers all three.\n\nLet me write the overview note (only once; will update later if needed).\n\nAlso queue remaining pages. Note recall batches bounded.\n\nI should write the note now and continue queueing pages.\n\nNote content in English/Chinese, must be verbatim in my response prose. Let me write it."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8606, "completion_tokens": 664, "total_tokens": 9270, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 207}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4254}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
