ve tools tested by Toolformer (calculator, question answering, machine translation, wikipedia search, search engine?) Need exact from paper. Page 10 table mentions calculator, search engine. The actual Toolformer tools list is in the paper section 3.2 maybe page 15. Better to wait for pages 13-16 content.\n\nSafer: write tool_use partial note with ToolBench 16,464 APIs from page 10, noting Toolformer tools need confirmation later. That's a valid incremental note. Then recall next pages.\n\nLet me write note titled \"tool_use\" content >=20 chars, evidence ids from delivered header: ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3 for page 10. The note must preserve findings; I'll update later.\n\nActually write_note title should be topic's note; earlier notes were \"overview\" and \"reasoning\". So title \"tool_use\".\n\nContent: Table 2 (p10) lists ToolBench with 16,464 APIs and ToolAlpaca 400 APIs; Toolformer row \"Call APIs\" with calculator and search engine. Need to confirm five tools in section 3.2.\n\nThen recall pages 13-18 to advance."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7630, "completion_tokens": 738, "total_tokens": 8368, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 454}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 3406}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
