ry of pending batch happens on next action. Let's write the multi_agent note now.\n\nContent: CAMEL uses inception prompting and role descriptions; agents stay in character. Page 37. Generative Agents evaluators count still unknown — will need later pages (maybe page 38/39, role-based simulation). So note as partial.\n\nKeep concise."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8381, "completion_tokens": 528, "total_tokens": 8909, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 281}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4029}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
