{"event": "context_exposure", "time": 1793331138.7847412, "run_id": "8e9ef9902567450190fcccd47b2220af", "seq": 336, "request": 25, "evidence_ids": ["ev-75546d247dedb90561b5", "ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba", "ev-baddfbae8db75139dd16", "ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886"], "note_ids": ["multi_agent", "overview", "reasoning", "tool_use"], "delivered_ranges": [{"id": "ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba", "start": 0, "end": 2382, "length": 2382}, {"id": "ev-baddfbae8db75139dd16", "start": 0, "end": 380, "length": 380}, {"id": "ev-75546d247dedb90561b5", "start": 0, "end": 4646, "length": 4646}, {"id": "ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886", "start": 0, "end": 5018, "length": 5018}], "fully_exposed_ids": ["ev-03c9580cc4ea3469a3d3", "ev-0aaa960f62d9cf1689f1", "ev-0fae89961d303fffa5a6", "ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055", "ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689", "ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2", "ev-2bcb169328f17ac85c9d", "ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa", "ev-2c646589154451e7b722", "ev-2f8846ab5b1bc7072a1b", "ev-345e6706309ac04ee927", "ev-4049593a30e2846f8394", "ev-41048209f3096e51f36b", "ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97", "ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1", "ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23", "ev-5803bf1c9a0002a5bd4f", "ev-5ee42fcee0f3b22d5203", "ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4", "ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62", "ev-75546d247dedb90561b5", "ev-76027d4e758f97793930", "ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b", "ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d", "ev-84af1a450301aa5252ba", "ev-89534f70bedf0ab45dc5", "ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c", "ev-94c9aed99ffbcdf31b43", "ev-97c7764bd93b97111551", "ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da", "ev-a30e6edea79391cf315d", "ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba", "ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2", "ev-b8db09947ef7c899cd9d", "ev-baddfbae8db75139dd16", "ev-bc885ff165a165a4d614", "ev-c3c928f38ebc0ac0c6cd", "ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248", "ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3", "ev-daeb56e673fc61cae0ef", "ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5", "ev-e1f0788ba35ab420a8a4", "ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186", "ev-e5b9499e130a976eefe2", "ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f", "ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886", "ev-f5fa865a87a2cd077881", "ev-f5fab558c5f762a67dcc", "ev-fdbf1c532c2133190b0f"]}
{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793331138.7865539, "run_id": "8e9ef9902567450190fcccd47b2220af", "seq": 337, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "multi_agent", "content": "4.2 Role-Based Interaction（p35-38）：CAMEL [Li et al., 2023a] 让两个 LLM 分别扮演 assistant 与 user，用 inception prompt 起步，随后互发消息推进任务；原文（p37）\"By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal\" → camel_prompting = inception_prompting。对话失控时会引入第三个 critic agent 保证建设性交流（p46）。4.3 社会模拟：Generative Agents 有 memory/planning/reflection 模块，Fig.27 示意 25 个 agent（p41）；可信度评估用 100 名人类评估者，按（1）记忆、（2）计划、（3）应对意外、（4）反思四类排序行为可信度，并比较四种架构，p47 原文：\"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\" → generative_agents_evaluators = 100。另有 1052 人访谈的 \"Simulating 1000 People\" 研究（p47）。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba", "ev-75546d247dedb90561b5", "ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886"], "section": "multi_agent"}}
