-reflection\"? Hmm. Actually likely \"reasoning and planning\"? Let me check page 52 pending.\n\nLet me write the outlook note with Table 4 now (partial) and then recall... actually the recall is pending; I should continue reading page 52. The instruction: \"Continue the pending batch; do not reread unchanged sources.\" So I need a recall or something to get page 52 delivered. The batch delivery happens automatically on next request? I should write a note first (that's an action), then next turn page 52 delivered? Hmm, likely the pending page will be delivered with the next model request. Let me write the outlook note now with Table 4 info, then next action will presumably get page 52.\n\nActually I need to be careful: writing a note with the evidence id for page 51 only. Let me do that, keeping the shared_foundations as pending TBD.\n\nAlternatively, do a recall to force page 52 delivery. The message said \"Continue the pending batch\". Perhaps calling recall again is redundant. Let me write the partial note action; the pending page should get delivered next.\n\nLet me write note with quote from page 51 Table 4.\n\nContent must be verbatim in my response prose. I'll write the note content as a string literal and also in prose.\n\nContent draft:\n\n\"5 Outlook（p50-52）：Table 4（p51）列出五个研究议题：Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety → agenda_topics = [training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]。表内挑战：Training Data 用推理期数据微调、稳定的 RL、VLA/多模态；Hallucination 用 self verification、mechanistic interpretability、open world models；Agent Behavior 用可扩展仿真基础设施与角色扮演、蒸馏小模型、行为模型与涌现行为；Self reflection 用模型内自反思与元推理、元认知；Safety 关注责任/可归责、隐私与公平、更广应用领域。局限：三个能力（reasoning/acting/interacting）都受益于的基础能力仍待 p52 确认（shared_foundations）。引文（p51）：'Table 4. Summary of Research Agenda for Agentic LLM' 及表中 Topic 栏。\"\n\nHmm, the quote should support all items; the note isn't graded for quotes, but keep good practice.\n\nLet me just write it."}, "logprobs": null, "