{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793331146.5118413, "run_id": "8e9ef9902567450190fcccd47b2220af", "seq": 362, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "outlook", "content": "5 Outlook（p50-52）：Table 4（p51）列出五个研究议题：Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety → agenda_topics = [training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]。表中挑战：Training Data 用推理期推理数据微调、收敛/稳定的强化学习、VLA 与语音等多模态信号；Hallucination 用 self verification、mechanistic interpretability、开放世界模型做探索；Agent Behavior 用可扩展仿真基础设施与角色扮演、把推理蒸馏到小模型、agent 与人类行为模型及涌现行为；Self reflection 用模型内自反思与元推理、元认知、自动化科学发现；Safety 关注助手责任与可归责性、数据隐私与公平、更广的应用领域。p50 正文强调大规模 agent 行为、知识蒸馏、合作与信任的涌现行为、以及自反思/元认知都是研究议程项目。结论称三类能力共同受益的两种基础能力待 p52 确认（shared_foundations）。引文（p51，连续区域）：'Topic Challenge ... Training Data ... Hallucination ... Agent Behavior ... Self reflection ... Safety ... Table 4. Summary of Research Agenda for Agentic LLM'。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9"], "section": "outlook"}}
