{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793331154.1990082, "run_id": "8e9ef9902567450190fcccd47b2220af", "seq": 372, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "outlook", "content": "5 Outlook（p50-52）：Table 4（p51）列出五个研究议题：Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety → agenda_topics = [training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]。挑战分别为：用推理期推理数据微调、收敛稳定的强化学习、VLA 与语音等多模态信号；self verification、mechanistic interpretability、open world models；可扩展仿真基础设施与角色扮演、把推理蒸馏到小模型、agent 与人类行为模型及涌现行为；模型内自反思与元推理、元认知与人格、自动化科学发现；助手责任与可归责性、数据隐私与公平、更广应用领域。p50 正文强调大规模 agent 行为、知识蒸馏、合作与信任的涌现行为、自反思/元认知。p51 原文：'Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants Table 4. Summary of Research Agenda for Agentic LLM'。三类能力共同受益的基础能力待 p52 结论确认。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9"], "section": "outlook"}}
