e Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants Table 4. Summary of Research Agenda for Agentic LLM'。p52 结论：三类能力都受益于 reasoning 与 self-verification → shared_foundations = [reasoning, self_verification]；原文 'and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.'。p52 还指出 acting/interacting 为预训练与微调生成训练数据，形成循环。\", evidence_ids=['ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9', 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3'], section='outlook')\nr2 = read_pdf(start_page=12, end_page=13)\nprint(r1)\nprint(r2)\n```", "tool_calls": null, "raw": {"_type": "ChatCompletion", "id": "d435abd8-24b0-4ceb-8021-ae44ae07d13e", "choices": [{"_type": "Choice", "finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "logprobs": null, "message": {"_type": "ChatCompletionMessage", "content": "I’ll finalize the outlook note with page 52’s conclusion, then re-read pages 12–13 to capture exact quotations for the reasoning answers.\n\n```python\nr1 = write_note(title='outlook', content=\"5 Outlook（p50-52）：Table 4（p51）列出五个研究议题：Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety → agenda_topics = [training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]。p51 原文连续表区：'Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of socie