 search engine, a translation system, and a calendar → toolformer_tools = [calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation_system, calendar]。ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI → toolbench_api_count = 16464（Table 2, p10 亦标 16,464 APIs，可互证）。相关：EasyTool 基于 ToolBench；ToolAlpaca 400 APIs/3938 实例；Gorilla/APIBench。难点：选对工具并总结结果，故有 planner–caller–summarizer 多模型分工（Fig.13, p23）。引文（p23 连续原文）：\"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar. Further works extend this to a larger range of tools. ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"\nModel-authored note multi_agent, sources=['paper.pdf']:\n4.2 Role-Based Interaction（p35-38）：CAMEL [Li et al., 2023a] 让两个 LLM 分别扮演 assistant 与 user，用 inception prompt 起步，随后互发消息推进任务；原文（p37）\"By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal\" → camel_prompting = inception_prompting。对话失控时会引入第三个 critic agent 保证建设性交流（p46）。4.3 社会模拟：Generative Agents 有 memory/planning/reflection 模块，Fig.27 示意 25 个 agent（p41）；可信度评估用 100 名人类评估者，按（1）记忆、（2）计划、（3）应对意外、（4）反思四类排序行为可信度，并比较四种架构，p47 原文：\"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\" → generative_agents_evaluators = 100。另有 1052 人访谈的 \"Simulating 1000 People\" 研究（p47）。\nModel-authored note outlook, sources=['paper.pdf']:\n5 Outlook（p50-52）：Table 4（p51）列出五个研究议题：Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety → agenda_topics = [training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]。p51 原文连续表区：'Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration