er works extend this to a larger range of tools. ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"\nModel-authored note multi_agent, sources=['paper.pdf']:\n4.2 Role-Based Interaction（p35-38）：CAMEL [Li et al., 2023a] 让两个 LLM 分别扮演 assistant 与 user，用 inception prompt 起步，随后互发消息推进任务；原文（p37）\"By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal\" → camel_prompting = inception_prompting。对话失控时会引入第三个 critic agent 保证建设性交流（p46）。4.3 社会模拟：Generative Agents 有 memory/planning/reflection 模块，Fig.27 示意 25 个 agent（p41）；可信度评估用 100 名人类评估者，按（1）记忆、（2）计划、（3）应对意外、（4）反思四类排序行为可信度，并比较四种架构，p47 原文：\"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\" → generative_agents_evaluators = 100。另有 1052 人访谈的 \"Simulating 1000 People\" 研究（p47）。\nModel-authored note outlook, sources=['paper.pdf']:\n5 Outlook（p50-52）：Table 4（p51）列出五个研究议题：Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety → agenda_topics = [training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]。p51 原文连续表区：'Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants Table 4. Summary of Research Agenda for Agentic LLM'。p52 结论：三类能力都受益于 reasoning 与 self-verification → shared_foundations = [reasoning, self_verification]；原文 'and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.'。p52 还指出 acting/interacting 为预训练与微调生成训练数据，形成循环。\nEvidence ev-0aaa960f62d9cf1689f1 | paper.pdf | page:11 | sha256=b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c\n                                                                                                                             Agentic LLM      •   1:11\n\n\n     Approach                                      Reasoning Technology            Acting/Assistant                      Interacting\n     Iterated Prisoner’s [Fontana et al., 2024]            LLM                   Cooperate/Defect                      Social Dilemma\n     Social Games [Akata et al., 2025]                     LLM                   Cooperate/Defect                  Battle of the Sexes, etc\n     GTBench [Duan et al., 2024]                         CoT/ToT                 Cooperate/Defect               Kuhn poker, liar’s dice, nim\n     GAMA-Bench [Huang et al., 2024a]                      LLM                   Cooperate/Defect                El Farol, Public Goods, etc\n     Theory of Mind [van Duijn et al., 2023]               LLM                     Theory of Mind                           Stories\n     NegotiationArena [Bianchi et al., 2024]               LLM                         Dialogue                          Negotiation\n     Alympics [Mao et al., 2023]                           LLM                  Multi-agent sandbox              Water-allocation challenge\n     MAgIC [Xu et al., 2024a]                              LLM                    social interaction              Social Deduction games\n     AucArena [Chen et al., 2023a]                         LLM                      Bidding/Goal                           Auction\n     EgoSocialArena [Hou et al., 2024]                     LLM                   Social Intelligence         Cognitive, Situational, Behavioral\n     Donor Game [Vallinder and Hughes, 2024]               LLM                     