stem, and a calendar.\"},\n     {\"question\":\"toolbench_api_count\",\"page\":23,\"quote\":\"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"}]},\n  {\"id\":\"multi_agent\",\n   \"summary\":\"交互能力部分先讲角色扮演式协作：CAMEL 用 inception prompting 与角色描述让两个 LLM 分别扮演 assistant 与 user 保持身份并共同推进任务，对话失控时还会引入 critic agent 维持建设性。随后扩展到社会模拟：Generative Agents 由记忆、计划与反思模块驱动大量 agent 的日常行为，其行为可信度由 100 名人类评估者按记忆、计划、应对意外与反思四类排序打分，并比较了多种架构；还有模拟上千人访谈的研究，说明多智能体实验已成为收集训练数据的来源。\",\n   \"application\":\"我的 agent 目前是单智能体：由同一模型完成读页、记笔记与写报告，尚未实现多智能体协作，也没有角色分工或 critic 复核环节，这些只是后续可尝试的方向；已实现的是跨批次的状态保持与笔记复用，可视为单体内的“记忆模块”。\",\n   \"answers\":{\"camel_prompting\":\"inception_prompting\",\"generative_agents_evaluators\":100},\n   \"evidence\":[\n     {\"question\":\"camel_prompting\",\"page\":37,\"quote\":\"By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal\"},\n     {\"question\":\"generative_agents_evaluators\",\"page\":47,\"quote\":\"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"}]},\n  {\"id\":\"outlook\",\n   \"summary\":\"Outlook 用一张表给出研究议程：Training Data（用推理期数据微调、收敛稳定的强化学习、语音等多模态信号）、Hallucination（自我验证、机制可解释性、开放世界模型探索）、Agent Behavior（可扩展的仿真基础设施、角色扮演、把推理蒸馏到小模型）、Self reflection（模型内自我反思与元推理、元认知与人格、自动化科学发现）、Safety（助手的责任与隐私公平等）。结论指出三类能力都受益于 reasoning 与 self-verification，并强调 acting 与 interacting 可为预训练和微调生成训练数据，形成循环。\",\n   \"application\":\"我在提交代码里已实现报告前后的 pytest 结构校验，但还没有把 self-verification 用在事实层面；可以按本文议程增加一步：写报告后自查每条引文是否真的出现在对应页的提取文本中，不一致就重读该页，这属于尚未实现、可优先尝试的改进。\",\n   \"answers\":{\"agenda_topics\":[\"training_data\",\"hallucination\",\"agent_behavior\",\"self_reflection\",\"safety\"],\n              \"shared_foundations\":[\"reasoning\",\"self_verification\"]},\n   \"evidence\":[\n     {\"question\":\"agenda_topics\",\"page\":51,\"quote\":\"Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants Table 4. Summary of Research Agenda for Agentic LLM\"},\n     {\"question\":\"shared_foundations\",\"page\":52,\"quote\":\"and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.\"}]}\n ]\n}\nr = write_file(\"report.json\", json.dumps(report, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), \"ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356\")\nprint(r['rc'] if 'rc' in r else r)\nt = run_command([\"python\",\"-m\",\"pytest\",\"-q\"], \".\")\nprint(t['rc'], t['stdout'][-1500:])\nq = recall(['ev-5ee42fcee0f3b22d5203','ev-4049593a30e2846f8394','ev-0aaa960f62d9cf1689f1'])\nprint('queued', q)", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'path': 'report.json', 'file_hash': 'ab3e36ea0acbadb6a29e20ad4ee6883f2a112c1db8a22eb329aa192b084e6887', 'before_hash': 'ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356', 'changed': True}\n0 .                                                                        [100%]\n1 passed in 0.01s\n\nqueued {'requested': [{'id': 'ev-5ee42fcee0f3b22d5203', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:12'}, {'id': 'ev-4049593a30e2846f8394', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:13'}, {'id': 'ev-0aaa960f62d9cf1689f1', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:11'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-89534f70bedf0ab45dc5', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:6'}, {'id': 'ev-5803bf1c9a0002a5bd4f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:7'}, {'id': 'ev-f5fa